  <img decoding="async" width="768" height="432" src="https://technologymanias.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/motor-team-mclaren-racing-partners-with-tezos-to-build-nft-platform-768x432-1.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image" alt="" loading="lazy" style="float:left; margin:0 15px 15px 0;" srcset="https://technologymanias.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/motor-team-mclaren-racing-partners-with-tezos-to-build-nft-platform-768x432-1.jpg 768w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/motor-team-mclaren-racing-partners-with-tezos-to-build-nft-platform-300x169.jpg 300w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/motor-team-mclaren-racing-partners-with-tezos-to-build-nft-platform-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/motor-team-mclaren-racing-partners-with-tezos-to-build-nft-platform-696x385.jpg 696w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/motor-team-mclaren-racing-partners-with-tezos-to-build-nft-platform-1068x601.jpg 1068w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/motor-team-mclaren-racing-partners-with-tezos-to-build-nft-platform-747x420.jpg 747w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/motor-team-mclaren-racing-partners-with-tezos-to-build-nft-platform-190x107.jpg 190w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/motor-team-mclaren-racing-partners-with-tezos-to-build-nft-platform-380x214.jpg 380w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/motor-team-mclaren-racing-partners-with-tezos-to-build-nft-platform-760x428.jpg 760w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/motor-team-mclaren-racing-partners-with-tezos-to-build-nft-platform.jpg 1280w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" /></p> 
  
  <p>
    <strong>On Thursday, McLaren Racing announced the British motor racing team selected Tezos as the organization’s official partner across the Indycar series, Formula One, and esports. Tezo will create a non-fungible token (NFT) platform for McLaren Racing in order to showcase the motorsport group’s world-class drivers and “illustrious racing heritage.”</strong>
  </p>
  
  <h2>
    McLaren and Tezos Team up to Construct an NFT Platform
  </h2>
  
  <p>
    The non-fungible token (NFT) economy has exploded and world-renowned automakers and motor racing teams are jumping in on the action. This week the German carmaker Porsche revealed it was launching NFT card assets called “Fanzone.” Now McLaren Racing has announced it will partner with Tezos in a multi-year technical partnership that is also focused on the NFT space.
  </p>
  
  <p>
    The racing team based at the McLaren Technology Centre in Woking, Surrey, England explained that Tezos and McLaren will innovate the NFT industry. “Tezos and McLaren Racing uniting to create a unique fan-focused NFT platform is an innovative step in an exciting and rapidly developing industry,” Lindsey Eckhouse, the director of licensing, ecommerce, and esports at McLaren Racing said.
  </p><figure id="attachment_467559" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-467559" style="width: 1600px" class="wp-caption aligncenter">
  
  <img decoding="async" srcset="https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/gp2013_132141_69i1776-abt-300x116.jpg 300w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/gp2013_132141_69i1776-abt-768x298.jpg 768w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/gp2013_132141_69i1776-abt-1024x397.jpg 1024w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/gp2013_132141_69i1776-abt-1536x595.jpg 1536w, https://technologymanias.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/gp2013_132141_69i1776-abt.jpg 1600w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px" loading="lazy" class="size-full wp-image-467559" src="https://technologymanias.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/gp2013_132141_69i1776-abt.jpg" alt="" width="1600" height="620" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-467559" class="wp-caption-text">McLaren Racing Limited is the second oldest active team, and second most successful Formula One team after Ferrari according to Wikipedia.</figcaption></figure> 
  
  <p>
    Tezos will also assist McLaren Racing presentations as a partner of the McLaren Shadow esports team. The partnership will allow the Tezos brand to be displayed across Arrow McLaren SP teams and the McLaren Formula One.
  </p>
  
  <p>
    “At McLaren, we are known for putting fans at the heart of everything we do, and this is another partnership which allows us to enter a space where fans can own key pieces of our team,” Eckhouse added.
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <!-- growjs zone placement 31 -->
    
    <ins> <ins class="growjs-placement"></ins> </ins> <!-- end of growjs zone placement -->
  </p>
  
  <p>
    This is not Tezos first fray with Formula One as the F1’s Red Bull Racing Honda team penned an NFT deal with Tezos last month. The partnership announcement said Tezos will help Red Bull Racing produce non-fungible tokens.
  </p>
  
  <p>
    “McLaren Racing has one of the longest and most illustrious legacies in racing, and we are excited that they have chosen to bring it to the Tezos blockchain through their NFT Fan engagement platform,” Hubertus Thonhauser, the chair at the Tezos Foundation explained on Thursday.
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <em><strong>What do you think about McLaren Racing teaming up with Tezos to launch an NFT platform? Let us know what you think about this subject in the comments section below. </strong></em>
  </p>
